        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>input_queue_size</name>
        <qualifiedname>cuvis_worker_settings_t::input_queue_size</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Size of the input queue for measurements and session files. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The worker has an input queue that accepts measurements and entire session files. To limit the memory usage, the queue is bounded by this value </para>
        </detaileddescription>
