        <name>supplementary_queue_size</name>
        <qualifiedname>cuvis_worker_settings_t::supplementary_queue_size</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Number of threads working on supplementary processing steps. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Set the number of processing slots / threads / queue size for supplementary processing steps in the worker Supplementary steps always include generating a view of the measurement, if a viewer is set in the worker. If no exporter is set, all steps are supplementary. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
